# Play test of The Sunken Liner (CIPlay sunken_liner, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# Lifeboat 7's camp on the west islet (6.5 m, -14 10); under water in the trench between the islets: the bow (8 20, bed
# 16 m down), the ballroom (x 2-14, z -11..-2, its floor 16 m down), the debris field (z -13..-23), the purser's office
# (x 2.5-11.5, z -32..-26, 24 m down) and the stern (13 -46) at the deep south end.
island The Sunken Liner
offset -0.2904 -0.4361
expect step 0
expect title The Polar Star
wait 5
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2

# Lifeboat 7's camp: the survivors' log, the camp chest with the steward's keys
walk -8 18 to -11 14 to -13 11.5 h=6.5
zone lifeboat
expect step 1
read Survivors' log
expect step 2
open Lifeboat 7's camp chest
expect story stewardkey 1
expect step 3

# Down to the bow: the wireless operator's last message on her deck
at 8 18 h=-4
zone bow
expect step 4
read Wireless operator's last message
expect step 5

# The ballroom: the air under its ceiling, the steward's cabinet with the purser's combination
at 8 -13.5 h=-13
zone ballroom
expect step 6
air ballroomair
open Chief steward's cabinet
expect story pursercode 1
expect step 7

# The stern's two lamps
at 12 -38 h=-16
zone stern
kill Angler fish
expect step 8

# The purser's office: his safe (the Polar Star, the pay chest's key), the ship's pay chest
at 7 -29 h=-22
zone purser
expect step 9
open Purser's safe
expect story sapphire 1
expect step 10
open Ship's pay chest
wait 2
expect done

# The other boxes: the trunks, the stores, the coal barrel, the box on the east islet
open First-class steamer trunk
open Third-class trunk
open Ship's stores crate
open Coal barrel
open Box in the cleft
